      "name": "nablum",
      "type": "instrument",
      "evidence": "the instrument designated as _nablum_, which we engrave (p. 87) from a manuscript of the ninth century at Angers"
    },
    {
      "id": "e4",
      "name": "citole",
      "type": "instrument",
      "evidence": "a small psalterium with strings placed over a sound-board was apparently the prototype of the _citole_"
